    "category": "Releases / August 2026 / Introducing Supernova Editor MCP",
    "url": "/latest/releases/august-2026/introducing-supernova-editor-mcp-29ohyDT6#search-f61f3643-fd81-4293-8a63-326ee625b46a-4"
